<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί̆χηλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cloven-hoofed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.71
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔμβασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					740
				</span></i>
			:—freq. in 
				Dor.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίχᾱλος</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				663a31
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with two pincers, prongs,</i> or <i>claws,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραγρέτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.92
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγουρος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				196
			</span></i> (Stat. Flacc.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				76.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίχιλα</span> (sic) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					37.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς δίχηλον διεσχισμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Spir.</u>
					1.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίχηλα ὕεια</span>
			pigs' <i>trotters,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διχάλα.</span></div>
